        "text": {
          "en": "1. This Agreement shall apply to investments made before or after its entry into force by investors of one Contracting Party in accordance with the laws and regulations of the other Contracting Party in the territory of the latter.\n[Illegible in source] Article 12\n1. The representatives of the two Contracting Parties shall meet from time to time as necessary to: a. review the implementation of this Agreement; b. exchange information on legal and other matters relating to investment; c. [Illegible in source]\n2. If either Contracting Party considers that any matter relating to investment so requires, the other Contracting Party shall promptly respond to the request for consultation and shall arrange the time and place therefor.\n[Illegible in source]"
        },
